    <headline>Heavy Rain Risk Area</headline>
    <description>The southerly and southeasterly winds prevail over the middle part of Thailand with thundershowers, gusty wind and isolated heavy rain including lightning strikes in the lower Northeast, the East and the Central including Bangkok and vicinity.  For the Andaman Sea and the Gulf, waves will be higher than 2 meters high in thundershower areas. </description>
    <instruction>People in the country should beware of thundershowers with gusty wind and heavy rains. All ships in the Andaman Sea and the Gulf should keep off thundershowers.</instruction>
